Attempted to pump additional 1,5m3 of contamination pill at 700lpm. Max pressure 71 bar, then dropped.
Stopped pumping. Appeared that suction was lost due to foam in pit and displacement tank.
Total change in pit level 4,5-5m3.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-06-16T23:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-06-17T00:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">4094</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Lined up to mud pumps. Increased flow gently to 400lpm, pumped totally 840ltrs. Pressure built up to 101 bar rapidly.
